<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The Lord, who left the heavens,</l><l>Our life and peace to bring,</l><l>To dwell in lowliness with men,</l><l>Their pattern and their King.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>He to the lowly soul</l><l>Doth still Himself impart,</l><l>And for His dwelling and His throne</l><l>Chooseth the pure in heart.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lord, we Thy presence seek;</l><l>May ours this blessing be;</l><l>Give us a pure and lowly heart,</l><l>A temple meet for Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
